		{
			title: "Creepirds and Hosts"
			x: -2.25d
			y: -0.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&5Creepirds and Hosts are hostile floating creatures that spawn anywhere in Creeponia."
				""
				"&5Creepirds can fly directly to you if they spot you, and if they land a hit, they will immediately explode. If you block with a shield, however, they will not, so be on guard!"
				""
				"&5Hosts themselves aren't strong, but they instead summon other Creepers to attack and defend for them. Be very careful and take the Host out as soon as you can, or you'll be overwhelmed in explosive enemies!"
				""
				"&5All hostile Creeponia creatures can drop Unstable Gunpowder, needed for various tools, weapons, and other items."
