		{
			title: "Explosively Angry"
			x: -1.0d
			y: 1.5d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5Hmm, okay I think we got a track on the next Corporate Boss, Bandit."
				""
				"&dOh fun, THIS guy..."
				""
				"&5Agreed, sis. Bandit, hope you got your explosive resistances up, as this guy is a real angry one."
				""
				"&dHe was your usual angry boss type, but he was able to use that anger to drive his team to the edge and obtain record profits. Doesn't matter that he had the highest turnover rate..."
				""
				"&5Which is why he got the promotion into the Game Server. Which he immediately used to increase his anger and rage power to explosive new heights."
				""
				"&dSo to get his attention, you'll need to make some Explosive Gems. These used to be how he increased his power..."
				""
				"&5Now we think its just... an addiction he needs to feed so he doesn't go into withdrawals. Kind of... unfortunate, you know?"
			]
			dependencies: ["148B2FCB551EF53B"]
			id: "169FB76FE86DBDB4"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4764B4F4458F23C5"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:explosive_gems"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "0DE94EB3BA026F86"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "C.R.E.E.P."
			x: 0.5d
			y: 0.5d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&5Creepy Raging Entity of Extreme Power, or C.R.E.E.P."
				""
				"&dThat's the acronym he chose for himself. And its a fitting name, I have to say."
				""
				"&5If you want to face down C.R.E.E.P., you'll need to find a Creep Altar, which can be found in Creeper HQ buildings. They are tall towers on the surface, topped with a large platform."
				""
				"&dThe center of that platform has a Creep Altar. Right Click the Explosive Gems on it to get C.R.E.E.P.s attention. "
				""
				"&5He'll constantly attack with exploding shots. They explode AS THEY TRAVEL and regularly when they hit something as well."
				""
				"&dWhen defeated, he has a chance of dropping his Concussion Staff or Creepified Sword."
			]
			dependencies: ["169FB76FE86DBDB4"]
			id: "42DAE67959FEFA97"
			tasks: [{
				id: "00A8E7E1E837D934"
