			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Explosively Addicting"
			x: 0.5d
			y: 2.5d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS BRIBE"
			description: [
				"&5If you want to avoid an explosive battle, Bandit, you'll want to feed his addiction instead."
				""
				"&dYep, at this point it isn't to fuel and increase his anger, its become like a habit. Feeding him a variety of explosives will actually calm him down."
				""
				"&5Unfortunately that means he won't easily get over the addiction. Might be better to fight him... but that's your choice, Bandit."
				""
				"&dYou'll need to unlock some DLC though. Some of the explosives you need are locked behind them. The only other problem you might run into is the need for so much Gunpowder."
				""
				"&5Well, Bandit IS in the land of Creepers now, so..."
