		{
			title: "The World of Prehistory"
			x: -7.25d
			y: -4.0d
			shape: "diamond"
			description: [
				"&5Bandit, looks like one of the two worlds you need to go to now is called Precasia, a prehistoric dimension chock full of ancient, once extinct creatures."
				""
				"&dWell, extinct now except for existing in the FOP's game server. For now. Until the world gets ground down and replaced at least."
				""
				"&5Then they'll just replace it with a new 'prehistoric' world with 'now extinct' creatures."
				""
				"&dSad state of affairs when it comes to the FOP game server. But hey, thats part of why we're doing this. "
				""
				"&5Speaking of... getting to Precasia is easy, the Realmstone is very simple to make. You just... need to have the DLC, of course."
				""
				"&dOf course."
			]
			dependencies: ["289B674FAC7C3441"]
			id: "5DD2B591646E5791"
			tasks: [{
				id: "61A1AD8CA6637F3F"
