			}]
		}
		{
			title: "The Land Before Clocks"
			x: -5.25d
			y: -4.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5Precasia is a pretty lush, overgrown world, full of large creatures. Dangerous creatures, too!"
				""
				"&dIt's fairly like the normal world, only if it was mostly forest and hills. It's got underground areas to explore too."
				""
				"&5At least it's got a mostly normal day and night cycle to it. "
				""
				"&dTrue. There's a bunch of neat things to explore here. And you'll want to search underground as well. Just keep yourself armed and armored."
				""
				"&5Watch your step though. That's all I'll say."
				""
				"&dBrother, please..."
				""
				"&5Hehe, don't worry. Bandit is vigilant."
