			x: -3.5d
			y: -4.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&5You'll want to explore the land and look for any caves or tunnels to the underground if you can. There isn't really a special metal or gemstone underground, but there are..."
				""
				"&dBones. Lots of bones. These ancient bones have been absorbing magical power for centuries, and are part of why the FOP seek out these prehistoric worlds, worlds that have survived to be ageless."
				""
				"&5They used to be part of huge creatures, but those are ones that didn't survive the age of time. But their bones... you can take their bones, and craft a variety of weapons and tools. "
				""
				"&dYou can also smelt em into Skeletal Ingots, making even more things!"
