			x: -4.5d
			y: -7.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&5Exploring through Precasia, you'll come across Tangle Thorns. Breaking these will eventually drop a Heart Fruit Seed, which you can grow like other seeds."
				""
				"&5The resulting crop will grow into Heart Fruit. BE CAREFUL WHEN EATING THEM! They will fill and satiate you quite well, but at the cost of some of your health! Nearly four hearts of damage."
