		{
			title: "Sound the War Horn"
			x: -1.0d
			y: -4.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&5Precasia is ruled by only one boss: Tyrosaur, a big, stomping manager nicknamed the Earthquake Creator."
				""
				"&dA nickname he earned from his refusal to get with the times, and stomp around the office until everything was done the way he had been doing it."
				""
				"&5Or that he 'discovered' on his own and, whether its a good idea or not, implemented said idea. This got his subordinates to either quit, or follow his orders without question."
				""
				"&dWhich has ended up with a predicament... not only did Tyrosaur move into the FOP Game Server, his 'army' of subordinates did too. He became a big dinosaur, and they became an army."
				""
				"&5Of skeletons."
				""
				"&dLots of skeletons... and you'll need to deal with both. Make yourself a Bone Horn, Bandit, and get ready..."
			]
			dependencies: ["6E5180FDF507CC49"]
			id: "7440103C453A765D"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2ECA61ED82323D8F"
				type: "item"
				item: {
					id: "aoa3:bone_horn"
					Count: 1b
					tag: {
						Damage: 0
					}
				}
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "2A2D072D30A54B13"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Army of the Dead"
			x: 0.5d
			y: -4.0d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&5You can choose whether to fight Tyrosaur or his army first. "
				""
				"&dIf you are going after the army, you're going to need to locate one of their Arenas. They move around and build an arena when they are staying in an area for a while. But it isn't long before Tyrosaur has them moving to a new location."
				""
				"&5The Arena looks like a big, square skeletal structure. At the center is an Army Block, which you can Right Click to summon the Skeleton Army."
				""
				"&dThe Skeleton Army will arrive in waves. You'll need to fight and defeat every wave of it to get to the leader of the Skeleton Army: Skeletron."
				""
				"&5There are lots of skeletons, lots of variety. So be well armed. Once you defeat Skeletron, they can drop a bone Fragments, a Skeletal Sword, or a Skeletal Crossbow."
			]
			dependencies: ["7440103C453A765D"]
			id: "6FB63B47738B7B70"
			tasks: [{
				id: "556261416B6FCD6A"
				type: "item"
				item: "kubejs:boss_card_skeletron"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "09D3C2587181E19B"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "The Earthquake Creator"
			x: 0.5d
			y: -5.0d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&5You can choose whether to fight Tyrosaur or his army first."
				""
				"&dIf you are after Tyrosaur, you'll need that Bone Horn. Anywhere in Precasia, you can hold Right Click with it, and you'll start sounding the horn, which will attract Tyrosaur to you."
				""
				"&5Watch out, Tyrosaur is constantly raging while attacking! Every five or so seconds, he'll jump up and stomp with all his feet, causing the ground to quake! If you are standing on the ground, you'll get hurt. As well, between stomps, he may charge you quickly, so keep moving and jumping!"
				""
				"&dOther than his card and trophy, Tyrosaur can drop Ivory, Sharp Claws, and Armor Plating, all good for crafting. He also has a chance of dropping a Primal Sword or a piece of Predatious armor."
			]
			dependencies: ["6FB63B47738B7B70"]
			dependency_requirement: "one_started"
			id: "30DF159D92EC69DD"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "2AFF8FC865541249"
